DESCRIPTION:iTorrent 2.2.0 | iTorrent\n\n## What's new:\n* Meet the new bui
 lt-in VLC player. Play compatible video and audio files directly in iTorre
 nt\, even while they are still downloading.\n* Enjoy Picture in Picture\, 
 playback speeds from 0.5x to 2x\, audio and subtitle track selection\, pre
 cise seeking\, and system media controls.\n* Take playback to a bigger scr
 een with AirPlay or a compatible player discovered on your local network.\
 n* Choose how pieces are downloaded with Sequential and First & Last prior
 ity modes\, making it easier to start watching sooner.\n* Select and share
  multiple completed files or entire folders in one go.\n\n## Improvements:
 \n* Refreshed the interface for iOS 26\, with Liquid Glass styling\, clean
 er dialogs\, and more polished navigation.\n* Made torrent details smoothe
 r and easier to use\, with clearer download-priority controls and private-
 torrent information.\n* Improved media previewing so iTorrent can offer th
 e best available player for each file.\n* Updated the torrent and media en
 gines for better compatibility\, stability\, and recovery from unexpected 
 errors.\n* Expanded and refined translations across all supported language
 s.\n\n## Fixes:\n* Fixed cases where magnet links could be saved incorrect
 ly.\n* Fixed a startup race condition that could interfere with launching 
 the app or completing initial setup.\n* Fixed toolbars and navigation beha
 ving incorrectly in iPad split-screen mode.\n* Fixed RSS downloads returni
 ng to the wrong screen.\n* Fixed torrent details sometimes getting stuck i
 n a continuous update loop.\n* Fixed several playback\, AirPlay\, and loca
 l-device connection issues.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/XITR
 IX/iTorrent/compare/v2.1.1-1...v2.2.0-1
